        </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="col">
        <h2>Sample GST Calculation in Excel</h2>
        <p>
            Example: Product Value ₹10,000<br>
            GST @@18% → CGST 9% = ₹900 + SGST 9% = ₹900<br>
            Total = ₹11,800
        </p>

        <hr />

        <h2>What Should GST Invoice PDF Include?</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Supplier GSTIN</li>
            <li>Invoice number & date</li>
            <li>Buyer details</li>
            <li>HSN/SAC code</li>
            <li>Taxable value</li>
            <li>CGST/SGST or IGST breakup</li>
        </ul>

